Anonymous-voting island: crates/server/assets/vote-island.js bundled with its one
dependency (@cloudflare/blindrsa-ts, which pulls sjcl) into a single self-hosted
file. Not a CDN dependency; built once and committed like htmx.min.js.

Bundled libraries:
  @cloudflare/blindrsa-ts 0.4.6  MIT (c) Cloudflare, Inc.   RFC 9474 blind RSA
  sjcl 1.0.9                     BSD-2-Clause / MIT (dual)   crypto primitives

Our island source is crates/server/assets/vote-island.js. Rebuild with
scripts/build_vote_js.sh (esbuild bundle + minify). No WASM, no network calls
beyond the same-origin token/cast endpoints.
